// App key for the preview API, sent as the X-SecureQR-Key header.
// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored, never commit it) and put
// the real key in place of the placeholder. Release builds fail without it;
// Debug builds work without a key against a local server.
// Note: "//" starts a comment in an xcconfig file, so the key cannot contain it.
SECUREQR_API_KEY = replace-with-the-app-key
